The page compares stage 02 with the first two, contrasts stage 05 with Hugging Face / OpenAI, and cites Nx in a defense.
notes:
Four related kill chains on csoh.org, and the page's related defense topics.

At stage 02, the page calls the reconnaissance here the same structural change described in the suspected AI-assisted AWS compromise and in Megalodon: the individual techniques are unremarkable, and the tempo is not.

At stage 05, it contrasts this campaign with the Hugging Face / OpenAI incident, where, the page says, the model chose the target itself.

Among the defenses, it says the Nx / s1ngularity chain makes the complementary point from the other side: an installed agent is a capability an attacker can inherit.

The page draws no other connection between this campaign and those four. The defense topics cover AI and machine learning security, Model Context Protocol and agent security, threat research and detection engineering.
